{"page":475,"width":1674,"height":2526,"text_angle":0,"lines":[{"text":"536","words":[{"text":"536","x":175,"y":143,"width":57,"height":28}]},{"text":"Chapter 12 입출력 시스템","words":[{"text":"Chapter","x":301,"y":145,"width":114,"height":28},{"text":"12","x":428,"y":146,"width":35,"height":22},{"text":"입출력","x":491,"y":146,"width":61,"height":26},{"text":"시스템","x":561,"y":149,"width":61,"height":24}]},{"text":"커널의 다른 부뿐이 입출력 장치를 관리히는 복잡한 일에 신경을 쓰지 않게 해준디.","words":[{"text":"커널의","x":304,"y":269,"width":87,"height":35},{"text":"다른","x":405,"y":269,"width":59,"height":35},{"text":"부뿐이","x":475,"y":270,"width":84,"height":35},{"text":"입출력","x":575,"y":271,"width":81,"height":35},{"text":"장치를","x":670,"y":272,"width":87,"height":34},{"text":"관리히는","x":768,"y":271,"width":118,"height":35},{"text":"복잡한","x":897,"y":271,"width":91,"height":34},{"text":"일에","x":1001,"y":270,"width":57,"height":36},{"text":"신경을","x":1074,"y":270,"width":93,"height":35},{"text":"쓰지","x":1179,"y":269,"width":61,"height":35},{"text":"않게","x":1257,"y":268,"width":62,"height":36},{"text":"해준디.","x":1335,"y":267,"width":105,"height":36}]},{"text":"입출력 장치 관련 기술들은 두 가지의 상충히는 궤도를 떠과간다. 한편으로는 관련","words":[{"text":"입출력","x":361,"y":327,"width":84,"height":35},{"text":"장치","x":462,"y":328,"width":55,"height":35},{"text":"관련","x":533,"y":328,"width":56,"height":35},{"text":"기술들은","x":606,"y":329,"width":114,"height":35},{"text":"두","x":733,"y":331,"width":29,"height":33},{"text":"가지의","x":776,"y":329,"width":84,"height":35},{"text":"상충히는","x":876,"y":328,"width":122,"height":36},{"text":"궤도를","x":1013,"y":328,"width":92,"height":35},{"text":"떠과간다.","x":1120,"y":326,"width":135,"height":37},{"text":"한편으로는","x":1273,"y":326,"width":166,"height":35},{"text":"관련","x":1453,"y":327,"width":61,"height":36}]},{"text":"인터페이스의 표준화가 늘어나고 있디는 것이다. 이런 경향은 새로 니오는 장치들이 기","words":[{"text":"인터페이스의","x":304,"y":385,"width":175,"height":35},{"text":"표준화가","x":494,"y":386,"width":118,"height":36},{"text":"늘어나고","x":623,"y":386,"width":116,"height":36},{"text":"있디는","x":754,"y":386,"width":86,"height":36},{"text":"것이다.","x":855,"y":386,"width":94,"height":36},{"text":"이런","x":966,"y":386,"width":58,"height":36},{"text":"경향은","x":1042,"y":385,"width":92,"height":36},{"text":"새로","x":1148,"y":385,"width":64,"height":35},{"text":"니오는","x":1227,"y":384,"width":99,"height":35},{"text":"장치들이","x":1340,"y":383,"width":128,"height":36},{"text":"기","x":1488,"y":386,"width":25,"height":35}]},{"text":"존 시스템에 쉽게 결합할 수 있도록 하기 위함이다. 다른 한 경힝으로는 입출력 장치가","words":[{"text":"존","x":301,"y":445,"width":31,"height":33},{"text":"시스템에","x":346,"y":443,"width":116,"height":36},{"text":"쉽게","x":479,"y":443,"width":54,"height":36},{"text":"결합할","x":551,"y":444,"width":85,"height":35},{"text":"수","x":648,"y":445,"width":29,"height":35},{"text":"있도록","x":691,"y":445,"width":87,"height":34},{"text":"하기","x":791,"y":444,"width":54,"height":36},{"text":"위함이다.","x":863,"y":444,"width":126,"height":36},{"text":"다른","x":1006,"y":443,"width":63,"height":37},{"text":"한","x":1082,"y":443,"width":32,"height":35},{"text":"경힝으로는","x":1129,"y":443,"width":162,"height":35},{"text":"입출력","x":1308,"y":441,"width":93,"height":36},{"text":"장치가","x":1420,"y":442,"width":97,"height":38}]},{"text":"갈수록 다양해진다는 것이다. 몇몇 장치들은 기존 장치외는 너무 다르므로 컴퓨터나 운","words":[{"text":"갈수록","x":302,"y":502,"width":90,"height":34},{"text":"다양해진다는","x":405,"y":502,"width":176,"height":35},{"text":"것이다.","x":595,"y":502,"width":90,"height":36},{"text":"몇몇","x":702,"y":502,"width":54,"height":36},{"text":"장치들은","x":771,"y":502,"width":119,"height":36},{"text":"기존","x":904,"y":503,"width":59,"height":35},{"text":"장치외는","x":976,"y":501,"width":126,"height":37},{"text":"너무","x":1117,"y":501,"width":62,"height":36},{"text":"다르므로","x":1193,"y":500,"width":132,"height":36},{"text":"컴퓨터나","x":1342,"y":500,"width":130,"height":36},{"text":"운","x":1484,"y":504,"width":33,"height":33}]},{"text":"영체제에 그들을 결합하는 것이 하나의 커다란 숙제가 된다. 이러한 문제는 하드웨어와","words":[{"text":"영체제에","x":3